# ToeJam & Earl III: Mission to Earth (5345000F), Nova. Built from the
# generic survey 1790948390-titleroutes2-3358315 (lane.titleroutes2,
# read 2026-10-02). Read from its route-frames, not guessed:
#   boot20 (071137): intro movie; boot40 (071158): the title, PRESS START;
#     booted (071220): the attract demo under PRESS START.
#   cycle 1 (071226 START / 071231 A): START -> ONE PLAYER GAME lit; A ->
#     STORY MODE lit.
#   cycle 2 (071237 START / 071244 A): START -> character select (ToeJam);
#     A -> his intro cutscene.
#   cycle 3 (071250 START / 071255 A): START -> the ship over Earth; black.
#   cycle 4 (071301 START / 071306 A): black (FPS 3, loading), then live
#     play: ToeJam on the stone circle of level 1, HUD up.
#   cycles 5-14: START toggles the PLAYER STATS panel (open on one START,
#     closed on the next); A in play is a jump.
#   play (071511..071601): ToeJam walks off the circle, past the bridge and
#     the fence to the cliff edge; 38-59 fps.
# So: 4 START/A cycles, a wait for the load, mark, then an exploring loop
# with no START: net-forward walking with a turn each way, a jump, a frame
# on every leg (one shot at a fixed loop phase can hide a parked player).
# If the load runs long, the loop's A presses land on black, harmlessly.
# Replay 1 (1790951866-titleroutes2-46925, ref 162ca56fd8): CONFIRMED.
# Same path; play on cycle 4's A (075718), mark 075730; live play to the
# end, 84 frames, static 0.009: median 51.6 fps, 98.8% at 30+, 29% at its
# own 60, no hang. The loop's right and left legs make a circuit of one
# hill (tree, fence, waterfall, cake), so the window is one corner of level
# 1, moving. Its crash=True is media.extractor tombstones (an Android
# system service), not hakuX.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 4 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
wait 10
shot loaded
mark gameplay               # CHECK: ToeJam in level 1, HUD up, no PLAYER STATS panel
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    shot fwd
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    press A
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    shot right
    wait 3
    shot fwd2
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    press A
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    shot left
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.5
}
